steps:
And the nginx.conf. max_fails and fail_timeout are nginx’s passive check; proxy_connect_timeout avoids waiting too long for a server that vanished:
upstream cantina {
    server app1:80 max_fails=1 fail_timeout=10s;
    server app2:80 max_fails=1 fail_timeout=10s;
}
server {
    listen 80;
    location / {
        proxy_pass http://cantina;
        proxy_connect_timeout 2s;
    }
}
